{"id":"ac886d6e507037e4","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-reflection-point.md","title":"ZFC Reflection Point","display":"df-zfc-reflection-point — ZFC Reflection Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-reflection-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-reflection-point"],"display":"df-zfc-reflection-point — ZFC Reflection Point","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-set10-cumulative-level-limit]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-reflection-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-reflection-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-reflection-point — ZFC Reflection Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6f76095fe7387ace\" href=\"?note=6f76095fe7387ace\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set10-cumulative-level-limit\">58-df-zfc-set10-cumulative-level-limit</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\varphi,\\bar a\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\varphi,\\bar a\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\\)</span> are the sourced coding interfaces</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> denotes metalinguistic truth for the displayed membership structure or the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic binary predicate defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_S\\)</span> is retained only as a legacy metasyntactic alias for downstream references; despite its suffix it is not a set predicate</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha,\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi),V_\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\to\\bigl(\n\\langle V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap V_\\alpha^2\\rangle\n\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\nV\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha,\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi),V_\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}\\to\\bigl(\n\\langle V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap V_\\alpha^2\\rangle\n\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\nV\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point\\text{-}compatibility}\n\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point\\text{-}compatibility}\n\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Truth in the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> cannot be supplied to the set-structure satisfaction predicate.  The definition therefore marks both truth comparisons and the reflection predicate as metatheoretic, while keeping the formula and parameter tuple set-coded.</li>\n<li>The legacy spelling is preserved so existing dependency edges remain resolvable, but consumers must propagate the metatheoretic judgment rather than treating it as an object-language relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set10-cumulative-level-limit","status":"resolved","id":"6f76095fe7387ace","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set10-cumulative-level-limit]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\varphi,\\bar a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha,\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi),V_\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}\\to\\bigl(\n\\langle V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap V_\\alpha^2\\rangle\n\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\leftrightarrow\nV\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\bar a]\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}reflection\\text{-}point\\text{-}compatibility}\n\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_S(\\alpha,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ReflectionPoint}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\alpha,\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":2280,"backlinks":[{"id":"a737662ef6790d6c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-reflection-point.md|58-df-zfc-reflection-point]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","65418b505fc53093","715a32e91161b34f","36d7463d215be751","6f76095fe7387ace"]}